**Case A, (a,b)=(1,2):** y = m, d = 2m, x = 3m. The 8 divisors of 1995 that are multiples of 5 are {5, 15, 35, 105, 95, 285, 665, 1995}, giving m = {1, 3, 7, 21, 19, 57, 133, 399}:

